# 9. Waypoint

Waypoint 本质上通常还是 Envoy：

```text
Waypoint = Envoy L7 Proxy
```

区别不是 Proxy 类型，而是部署模型。

Sidecar：

```text
1 Pod ≈ 1 Envoy
```

Ambient：

```text
1 Node → ztunnel
按需 → waypoint
```

## 9.1 为什么 Waypoint 更偏“目标端”

假设：

```text
frontend → payment
```

payment 声明使用 waypoint：

```text
frontend
   ↓
ztunnel
   ↓
payment-waypoint
   ↓
payment
```

Waypoint 更像：

> payment 前面的一扇门

多个调用者：

```text
frontend ──────┐
order ─────────┤
inventory ─────┤
               ▼
       payment-waypoint
               ↓
            payment
```

## 9.2 创建 Waypoint

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Gateway
metadata:
  name: api-waypoint
  namespace: app
spec:
  gatewayClassName: istio-waypoint
```

或者：

```bash
istioctl waypoint apply \
  -n app \
  --name api-waypoint
```

## 9.3 Service 绑定 Waypoint

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app
  labels:
    istio.io/use-waypoint: api-waypoint
```

数据路径：

```text
order
 ↓
ztunnel
 ↓
api-waypoint
 ↓
ztunnel
 ↓
deployment-api
```

