# 11. 完整 Ingress Gateway → HTTP API 示例

目标：

```text
Internet HTTPS
      ↓
Istio Ingress Gateway
      ↓
HTTPRoute
      ↓
deployment-api Service :8080
      ↓
Ambient workload
      ↓
Pod :8080 HTTP
```

目录：

```text
istio-demo/
├── 00-namespace.yaml
├── 01-api.yaml
├── 02-gateway.yaml
├── 03-http-redirect.yaml
├── 04-api-route.yaml
├── 05-security.yaml
└── 06-gateway-ha.yaml
```

## 11.1 00-namespace.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: istio-ingress

---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: app
  labels:
    istio.io/dataplane-mode: ambient
    gateway-access: "true"
```

## 11.2 01-api.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app

---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: deployment-api-nginx
  namespace: app
data:
  default.conf: |
    server {
        listen 8080;

        default_type application/json;

        location = /healthz {
            return 200 '{"status":"ok"}';
        }

        location /api/orders {
            return 200 '{"service":"deployment-api","message":"orders api","path":"$uri"}';
        }

        location / {
            return 404 '{"error":"not found"}';
        }
    }

---
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app
spec:
  replicas: 2

  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: deployment-api

  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: deployment-api

    spec:
      serviceAccountName: deployment-api

      containers:
      - name: api
        image: nginx:1.27-alpine

        ports:
        - name: http
          containerPort: 8080

        volumeMounts:
        - name: nginx-config
          mountPath: /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
          subPath: default.conf

        readinessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /healthz
            port: 8080

        livenessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /healthz
            port: 8080

      volumes:
      - name: nginx-config
        configMap:
          name: deployment-api-nginx

---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app
spec:
  type: ClusterIP

  selector:
    app: deployment-api

  ports:
  - name: http
    port: 8080
    targetPort: 8080
```

## 11.3 TLS Secret

实验环境：

```bash
openssl req \
  -x509 \
  -nodes \
  -days 365 \
  -newkey rsa:2048 \
  -keyout api.example.com.key \
  -out api.example.com.crt \
  -subj "/CN=api.example.com" \
  -addext "subjectAltName=DNS:api.example.com"
```

创建 Secret：

```bash
kubectl create secret tls api-example-com-tls \
  --cert=api.example.com.crt \
  --key=api.example.com.key \
  -n istio-ingress
```

生产建议：

```text
cert-manager + Let's Encrypt / 企业 CA
```

## 11.4 02-gateway.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Gateway
metadata:
  name: public-gateway
  namespace: istio-ingress

spec:
  gatewayClassName: istio

  listeners:

  - name: http
    hostname: "api.example.com"
    port: 80
    protocol: HTTP

    allowedRoutes:
      namespaces:
        from: Selector
        selector:
          matchLabels:
            gateway-access: "true"

  - name: https
    hostname: "api.example.com"
    port: 443
    protocol: HTTPS

    tls:
      mode: Terminate
      certificateRefs:
      - group: ""
        kind: Secret
        name: api-example-com-tls

    allowedRoutes:
      namespaces:
        from: Selector
        selector:
          matchLabels:
            gateway-access: "true"
```

关键：

```yaml
gatewayClassName: istio
```

表示普通 Istio Gateway。

## 11.5 03-http-redirect.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: http-to-https
  namespace: app

spec:
  parentRefs:
  - group: gateway.networking.k8s.io
    kind: Gateway
    name: public-gateway
    namespace: istio-ingress
    sectionName: http

  hostnames:
  - "api.example.com"

  rules:
  - filters:
    - type: RequestRedirect
      requestRedirect:
        scheme: https
        port: 443
        statusCode: 301
```

## 11.6 04-api-route.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app

spec:
  parentRefs:
  - group: gateway.networking.k8s.io
    kind: Gateway
    name: public-gateway
    namespace: istio-ingress
    sectionName: https

  hostnames:
  - "api.example.com"

  rules:
  - matches:
    - path:
        type: PathPrefix
        value: /api

    backendRefs:
    - group: ""
      kind: Service
      name: deployment-api
      port: 8080
      weight: 1
```

这里：

```text
Gateway
=
门在哪里

HTTPRoute
=
进门以后往哪里走
```

