# 13. Waypoint 配置 Retry / Timeout

目标：

```text
order-service
     ↓
ztunnel
     ↓
deployment-api-waypoint
     ↓
deployment-api
```

Retry / Timeout 由：

```text
Waypoint Envoy
```

执行。

## 13.1 创建 Waypoint

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Gateway
metadata:
  name: deployment-api-waypoint
  namespace: app
spec:
  gatewayClassName: istio-waypoint
```

## 13.2 Service 绑定 Waypoint

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: deployment-api
  namespace: app
  labels:
    istio.io/use-waypoint: deployment-api-waypoint
spec:
  selector:
    app: deployment-api
  ports:
  - name: http
    port: 8080
    targetPort: 8080
```

## 13.3 Mesh HTTPRoute

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: deployment-api-mesh-route
  namespace: app

spec:
  parentRefs:
  - group: ""
    kind: Service
    name: deployment-api
    port: 8080

  rules:
  - backendRefs:
    - group: ""
      kind: Service
      name: deployment-api
      port: 8080

    timeouts:
      request: 10s
      backendRequest: 2s

    retry:
      codes:
      - 500
      - 502
      - 503
      - 504

      attempts: 2
      backoff: 200ms
```

关键：

```yaml
parentRefs:
- kind: Service
  name: deployment-api
```

表示：

> 这条 Route 是 deployment-api Service 的 Mesh L7 配置。

真正执行：

```text
deployment-api 对应的 Waypoint
```

## 13.4 Timeout

```yaml
timeouts:
  request: 10s
  backendRequest: 2s
```

解释：

```text
backendRequest
=
每一次调用 backend 最多等多久

request
=
整个请求，包括 retry 在内最多多久
```

例：

```text
Attempt #1
 ↓
Pod A
 ↓
2 秒 timeout

retry

Attempt #2
 ↓
Pod B
 ↓
200 OK
```

## 13.5 attempts

```yaml
attempts: 2
```

含义：

```text
初始请求 1 次
+
最多 retry 2 次
=
最多 3 次 backend request
```

## 13.6 Retry 风险

不要随便对非幂等接口 retry：

```text
POST /payment
POST /create-order
POST /send-message
```

因为：

```text
第一次实际上已经成功
但 response 丢了
 ↓
Waypoint retry
 ↓
重复执行
```

更适合：

```text
GET
HEAD
幂等 PUT
支持 Idempotency-Key 的 API
```

